/-!
# Field 13 on v3: cut facts for `EntryClean` / `ExitClean` (LT29)

Single-wire cut facts (`ZeroAt`) along the piece lists of LT25's
`StairField13V3`, and the static facts about the field coordinate maps.
-/

section

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxRecDepth 30000
set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000

namespace ECDSAAdd.Entrant.StairField13V3Clean

open ECDSAAdd Arithmetic Challenge
