/-!
# The 14 hosted packet groups are good for all 44 physical holes (S4)

Under `TP` the five sites `4835 .. 4839` are the labels `736 .. 740`, the first five exclusive
roles.  As in `StairSiteEasyGroups`, a label of a hosted group is a host or a non-rebound label
of the placed loaned group; the latter is not an exclusive role at all
(`basePacket_tgt` and the rebinding), and the hosts avoid `736 .. 740` by one Boolean pass.
-/

section

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxRecDepth 100000
set_option maxHeartbeats 16000000
